<title>USA: TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000</p>
<p>Ameritech Cup women's tennis tournament Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat 8-Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria)</p>
<p>6-3 5-7 6-1</p>
<p>3-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Paola Suarez (Argentina) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-0</p>
<p>7-Brenda Schultz McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Linda Wild</p>
<p>(U.S.) 7-5 6-7 (5-7) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Quarterfinal round</p>
<p>1-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Irina Spirlea (Romania) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
